(text "Normal sensor supply10.8..16.5V after diode. Control receives measured voltage over CAN.\nDiode drop must be compensated in reported heater supply; current implementation has no local supply ADC.\nBosch LSU4.9 steady heater power7.5W/channel; cold start, fuse coordination and thermal tests pending." (at 20 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "845c9d32-d3c8-5989-bb12-40feb360fd2e"))
